>Is there some trick to become nymph-aware... please help me!!
Wear a ring of adornment, the nymph will steal first that ring (this is not a
joke)!

Try to be quiet! Wear elven boots or an elven cloak (stealth), do not kick a
door, monster or large box if it is not necessary. Kicking makes noise and can
wake up nymphs (a lock pick can prevent you against nymphs). 

If this does not work, use your wands, (poisoned) darts if there are some
places between you and the nymph. If not and you have speed walk away until
you get your extra move. Throw a (poisoned) dart or zap a wand of fire, cold
etc (not an unidentified wand, it can be a wand of MAKE INVISIBLE, I did this
once).

You can also apply a mirror, the nymph will steal it.

